      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC7513042::rubric_card::000::c40db9eaa7"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "Grain refinement strengthens the material by reducing flaw sizes.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Interstitial atoms and solutes provide solid-solution strengthening in the processed composite.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Stable phases and robust interphase bonding enhance oxidation resistance.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The processed composite has a room-temperature compressive fracture strength of about 1542 MPa.",
