      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC7513042::rubric_card::000::c40db9eaa7"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "The as-cast NbMoCrTiAl alloy has a compressive strength of about 1010 MPa.",
